# Worker runtime variables for local development.
#
# `vite dev` loads this file, and `flue run` loads it too. Deployed Workers
# instead read real Worker vars and secrets — see the README.
#
# Copy to .env and fill in:  cp .env.example .env
# .env is gitignored. Never commit real values.

# --- Model selection ---------------------------------------------------------
#
# Optional. Omit it to use the Workers AI fallback, which is keyless but bills
# the Cloudflare account you export in your shell.
#
# Any specifier from https://flueframework.com/models.json works:
#
#   AGENT_MODEL=openrouter/moonshotai/kimi-k2.6
#   AGENT_MODEL=opencode/claude-sonnet-4-6
#   AGENT_MODEL=opencode-go/claude-sonnet-4-6
#   AGENT_MODEL=cloudflare/@cf/moonshotai/kimi-k2.6

# --- Provider keys -----------------------------------------------------------
#
# Set only the key for the provider you selected above. Uncomment the one you
# need; leave the rest commented so they stay unset rather than empty.

# OpenRouter
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# OpenCode Zen and Go (one key covers both provider ids)
# OPENCODE_API_KEY=

# Anthropic
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# OpenAI
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
